H["Authenticated developers"]:::human
CLIENT["ChatGPT-style thin client<br/>CHAT • PROJECT • RUN • ARTIFACTS • STUDIO"]:::client
SPEC["Accepted BuildSpecification<br/>versioned implementation contract"]:::domain
MEDIA["Developer Media Fabric<br/>raster generation/edit + deterministic assets"]:::tool
EDGE["Private edge<br/>Tailscale + TLS + reverse proxy"]:::security
API["/api/v1 + SSE"]:::api
CP["Authoritative Control Plane<br/>PostgreSQL-backed project/run/workflow/task/job truth"]:::authority
ORCH["Executive orchestration<br/>requirements → TaskGraph → specialists"]:::agent
CTX["Context / Artifact / Memory fabric"]:::context
MODEL["Model fabric<br/>routing + vLLM + deployment profiles<br/>ephemeral pinned-model hydration"]:::model
POLICY["Policy + Tool + Secret enforcement"]:::security
TOOLS["Execution tools<br/>repo • shell • build • test • Git • research"]:::tool
VERIFY["Deterministic verification<br/>independent assurance + integration gate"]:::verify
SCHED["Workflow + compute schedulers<br/>capacity controller"]:::sched
COMPUTE["Replaceable compute<br/>CPU sandboxes + RunPod GPU workers"]:::compute
DUR["Durable execution<br/>Action Journal + checkpoints + recovery"]:::durable
STORE["Persistence<br/>PostgreSQL + BlobStore + workspaces + backups"]:::data
COST["Cost / budget ledger"]:::cost
OBS["Observability / health / audit"]:::ops
GIT["Reviewable isolated Git state / PR"]:::tool
OUT["Verified project result<br/>human retains final authority"]:::authority

